# ============================================================
# F-25: kfold_campaign raw per-fold / per-run dumps are IGNORED.
# results/ and kfold_campaign/ are NOT globally ignored, so the
# JSON/CSV campaign summaries stay tracked by default. Only the
# raw dump directories (epoch_log.jsonl + per_slice_dice.jsonl,
# plus untracked checkpoints) are excluded so `git add -A` never
# re-tracks >70 MB of per-fold logs.
# ============================================================
.scratch/
results/kfold_campaign/*_fold*of5/
results/kfold_campaign/[0-9][0-9]_g*/
results/kfold_campaign/r31_*/
results/kfold_campaign/smoke_*/
# Keep the canonical gradnorm probe runtime logs (negate global *.jsonl)
!results/kfold_campaign/canonical_gradnorm_probe/
!results/kfold_campaign/canonical_gradnorm_probe/epoch_log.jsonl
!results/kfold_campaign/canonical_gradnorm_probe/probe_log.jsonl
